  "ACES (ACEScct grading)": "ACES（ACEScct 调色）",
  "OpenColorIO config": "OpenColorIO 配置",
  "OpenColorIO configuration…": "OpenColorIO 配置…",
  "ACES output transform": "ACES 输出变换",
  "sRGB (RRT + ODT)": "sRGB（RRT + ODT）",
  "Rec.709 (BT.1886)": "Rec.709（BT.1886）",
  "OpenColorIO: a config you load (with its LUT files) decides how each clip is read, the working space, and the display, view and looks the monitor and exports show. Settings are stored in the project and are one undo step. ACES: footage enters through an input transform (Interpret footage picks it per footage item), compositing runs in ACEScg half float, grading in ACEScct, and the picture leaves through the ACES RRT and the output transform above. HDR10 and HLG exports use the Rec.2020 1000 nit transforms. The monitor, scopes and SDR exports show the output transform. Frames with adjustment layers or text behind subject still render display-referred.": "OpenColorIO：你加载的配置（及其 LUT 文件）决定每个片段的读取方式、工作空间，以及监视器和导出所显示的显示、视图和外观。设置保存在项目中，一步撤销。ACES：素材经输入变换进入（在“解读素材”中按素材选择），合成在 ACEScg 半浮点中运行，调色在 ACEScct 中进行，画面经 ACES RRT 和上方的输出变换输出。HDR10 和 HLG 导出使用 Rec.2020 1000 尼特变换。监视器、示波器和 SDR 导出显示输出变换。带调整图层或主体后文字的帧仍按显示参考渲染。",
  "HDR graphics white": "HDR 图形白色",
  "Where titles, shapes, stickers and subtitles sit in an HDR project: the brightness of their white. 203 nits is ITU-R BT.2408 graphics white. Video is not affected.": "在 HDR 项目中，标题、形状、贴纸和字幕所处的亮度：它们白色的亮度。203 尼特是 ITU-R BT.2408 图形白色。视频不受影响。",
  "Sequence start timecode": "序列起始时间码",
  "Written into MOV and MXF exports from the desktop app and used as the record timecode of EDL, XML and FCPXML exports. Set a custom value in the Export dialog.": "写入桌面版导出的 MOV 和 MXF，并用作 EDL、XML 和 FCPXML 导出的记录时间码。可在导出对话框中设置自定义值。",
  "Aspect ratio": "画面比例",
  "Sequence color space": "序列色彩空间",
  "Rec.709 (default)": "Rec.709（默认）",
  "Rec.2100 PQ (HDR10)": "Rec.2100 PQ（HDR10）",
  "Rec.2100 HLG": "Rec.2100 HLG（混合对数伽马）",
  "Rec.2020 (wide gamut SDR)": "Rec.2020（广色域 SDR）",
  "HDR footage detected: switch to {space}": "检测到 HDR 素材：切换到 {space}",
  "Rec.2020 and Rec.2100 switch to the HDR working mode: compositing and grading run in half-float scene-linear Rec.2020 (highlights above SDR white are kept). The preview shows a tone-mapped SDR view, scopes read in nits, and the export defaults to the sequence transfer (HEVC Main10 or ProRes, tagged BT.2020 with PQ or HLG).": "Rec.2020 和 Rec.2100 会切换到 HDR 工作模式：合成和调色在半浮点场景线性 Rec.2020 中运行（保留高于 SDR 白色的高光）。预览显示色调映射后的 SDR 视图，示波器以尼特读取，导出默认使用序列传输函数（HEVC Main10 或 ProRes，标记 BT.2020 及 PQ 或 HLG）。",
  "Spatial Interpolation": "空间插值",
